Description: Tailscale Funnel reverse proxy for ariacompute services
 Routes external HTTPS traffic (by Host header) to internal ariacompute
 services through Tailscale Funnel. Transparent, Host-based reverse proxy
 with YAML + CLI configuration and systemd integration.
